[{"client_msg_id":"0c0a240d-f595-4d32-aa8d-32e33a8d9dee","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"在宅ワークこわちか","ts":"1620567200.298700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n8dk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d6eb0b0-47c3-4400-9f16-1eae99f57d53","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1391373114760744966?s=19|https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1391373114760744966?s=19\u003e","ts":"1620567186.298500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e: 在宅ワークで体重変わりましたか？","id":1,"author_name":"mattn","author_subname":"@mattn_jp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1391373114760744966","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361128357698572292/61_qdnll_normal.jpg","text":"在宅ワークで体重変わりましたか？","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1620564175,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1391373114760744966?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1391373114760744966?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6yo+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43ec47e1-7278-4fe0-a591-6d72e0ae749b","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"タバタ式でやってます。\nバーピージャンプとジャンピングジャックをやりすぎて、足にマメができて痛いです…","ts":"1620552569.297800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gkMjo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6484846-a743-4c92-aa40-cbe83d902049","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"いいですよね。やり始めは運動会終わった後みたいなキツさでしたけどw\n去年の健康診断で脂肪肝って言われて、HIIT がいいらしく はじめましたw\n\u003chttps://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4\u003e","ts":"1620552541.297200","attachments":[{"fallback":"血糖値も肝機能も改善する！ 1日｢たった4分｣の運動で身体能力が若返るワケ｜OCEANS オーシャンズウェブ","id":1,"title":"血糖値も肝機能も改善する！ 1日｢たった4分｣の運動で身体能力が若返るワケ｜OCEANS オーシャンズウェブ","title_link":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4","text":"年を取るにつれて、体力の衰えや認知機能の低下など健康面での心配が増えていきます。しかし、本格的な運動や脳のトレーニングとなるとなかなか実行できないという人は多いかもしれません。そんな人々のために医師であり科学者でもある川田浩志氏が勧めるのが、HIITという最新トレーニングです。","image_url":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/img_e757b654ceb68978fe5c6d2c0f9fe56f108978.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"oceans.tokyo.jp","service_icon":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/wp-content/themes/oceans/dist/assets/images/apple-touch-icon-180x180.png","from_url":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4","original_url":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4"}],"edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1620553130.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3M1tn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af205ca6-b630-4e9a-9cf9-a0818b51ec0a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"HIITはいいですよ!!最近はノルウェー式でやってますけど死にそうになるので毎日やるのはおすすめしません","ts":"1620551930.294100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UjKB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddda2480-968f-4cd0-ad04-2abf5cba7935","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/slacklog/search.html?q=HIIT\u003e\n既出だった\n結構皆さんされてる？","ts":"1620551813.293100","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1620551887.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P/C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97aeaf93-734a-460e-8226-d23427bcf807","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"既出かもですが HIIT やってます。最近ニュースで見かけたので貼っときます。\n\u003chttps://www.newsweekjapan.jp/stories/woman/2021/05/15-2.php\u003e\n\n11-3 月に毎日 4 分（20 秒バーピー 10 秒休憩 x 8 セット）やったら 4 kg 痩せたので、\n最近は 2,3 日に 1 回にしてます。心肺機能上げる